{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIwL01lZXRpbmclMjBUaGUlMjBCZWF0bGVzJTIwSW4lMjBJbmRpYSUyMCUyODIwMjAlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Meeting The Beatles In India","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/lckvWRHLW0ckMfEwZynwICZ1Zde.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/umAKhkVwU94gj9Tiu4H10237R63.jpg","description":"Filmmaker Paul Saltzman retraces his journey of 50 years ago when he spent a life-changing time with the Beatles at the Maharishi Mahesh Yogi's ashram on the banks of the Ganges River. In 1968, he discovered his own soul, learned meditation, which changed his life, and hung out with John, Paul, George and Ringo. Fifty years later, he finds \"Bungalow Bill\" in Hawaii; connects with David Lynch about his own inner journey; as well as preeminent Beatles historian, Mark Lewisohn; Academy Award nominated film composer, Laurence Rosenthal; and Pattie and Jenny Boyd. And much of this is due to Saltzman's own daughter, Devyani, reminding him that he had put away and forgotten these remarkably intimate photographs of that time in 1968.","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Documentary","Music","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"85 min","cast":["John Lennon","Paul McCartney","George Harrison","Ringo Starr","Maharishi Mahesh Yogi","David Lynch","Morgan Freeman","Pattie Boyd"],"director":["Paul Saltzman"],"released":"2020-09-09T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Jai Guru Deva!","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"John Lennon","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iawyLGZKTr7eD8XWhNGjM8Cb95x.jpg"},{"name":"Paul McCartney","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sCPsv9ueP5UR6BkMSmRDlwbra6S.jpg"},{"name":"George Harrison","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zwUO2gnKBnSrKOB9hnhI9GdOX6e.jpg"},{"name":"Ringo Starr","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7fSrrdl90BYdR3dtOnNkosOw0kw.jpg"},{"name":"Maharis